  "atoms": [
    {
      "id": "atom-1",
      "text": "Right after a time where we're going through a pandemic that lost 22 million jobs at the height, we've already added back 11.6 million jobs.",
      "sourceText": "Right after a time where we're going through a pandemic that lost 22 million jobs at the height, we've already added back 11.6 million jobs.",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 140,
      "role": "NUMERIC_CONSTRAINT"
    }
  ],
  "evidence": [
    {
      "atomId": "atom-1",
      "spans": [
        {
          "id": "doc-12b587084e5a::sentence-111",
          "documentId": "doc-12b587084e5a",
          "text": "4. Information on the Pandemic Emergency Unemployment Compensation (PEUC) program can be found in Unemployment\n",
          "start": 6440,
          "end": 6551,
          "contextSpans": [],
          "context": "4. Information on the Pandemic Emergency Unemployment Compensation (PEUC) program can be found in Unemployment"
        },
        {
          "id": "doc-12b587084e5a::sentence-109",
          "documentId": "doc-12b587084e5a",
          "text": "3. Information on the Pandemic Unemployment Assistance (PUA) program can be found in UIPL 16 -20: PUA Program\n",
          "start": 6318,
          "end": 6428,
          "contextSpans": [],
          "context": "3. Information on the Pandemic Unemployment Assistance (PUA) program can be found in UIPL 16 -20: PUA Program"
        },
        {
          "id": "doc-12b587084e5a::sentence-65",
          "documentId": "doc-12b587084e5a",
          "text": "During the week ending March 27, 51 states reported 7,053,575 continued weekly claims for Pandemic Unemployment\n",
          "start": 3547,
          "end": 3659,
          "contextSpans": [],
          "context": "During the week ending March 27, 51 states reported 7,053,575 continued weekly claims for Pandemic Unemployment"
        },
        {
          "id": "doc-a46f0d421238::sentence-55",
          "documentId": "doc-a46f0d421238",
          "text": "This measure provides useful insights into the current economic situation because it can represent the number of jobs added or lost in an economy. ",
          "start": 1759,
          "end": 1906,
          "contextSpans": [
            {
              "id": "doc-a46f0d421238::sentence-54",
              "documentId": "doc-a46f0d421238",
              "text": "This measure accounts for approximately 80 percent of the workers who contribute to Gross Domestic Product (GDP).\n",
              "start": 1645,
              "end": 1759,
              "direction": "PREVIOUS"
            }
          ],
          "context": "This measure accounts for approximately 80 percent of the workers who contribute to Gross Domestic Product (GDP). This measure provides useful insights into the current economic situation because it can represent the number of jobs added or lost in an economy."
        },
        {
          "id": "doc-24baaeff66a9::sentence-6",
          "documentId": "doc-24baaeff66a9",
          "text": "CDC also said it issued federal quarantine orders to the 195 U.S. citizens who repatriated to the U.S. from China on Jan. 29 because of the 2019-nCoV outbreak, the first mandatory quarantine in over 50 years. ",
          "start": 818,
          "end": 1027,
          "contextSpans": [
            {
              "id": "doc-24baaeff66a9::sentence-5",
              "documentId": "doc-24baaeff66a9",
              "text": "In a CDC call with clinicians, the agency stressed that its guidance will continue to change over time as more is learned about the outbreak, and urged clinicians to continue to check CDC’s resources for updates.\n",
              "start": 605,
              "end": 818,
              "direction": "PREVIOUS"
            }
          ],
          "context": "In a CDC call with clinicians, the agency stressed that its guidance will continue to change over time as more is learned about the outbreak, and urged clinicians to continue to check CDC’s resources for updates. CDC also said it issued federal quarantine orders to the 195 U.S. citizens who repatriated to the U.S. from China on Jan. 29 because of the 2019-nCoV outbreak, the first mandatory quarantine in over 50 years."
        },
        {
          "id": "doc-24baaeff66a9::sentence-9",
          "documentId": "doc-24baaeff66a9",
          "text": "“If we take strong measures now, we may be able to blunt the impact of the virus on the United States,” said Nancy Messonnier, M.D., director of CDC’s National Center for Immunization and Respiratory Diseases.\n",
          "start": 1330,
          "end": 1540,
          "contextSpans": [
            {
              "id": "doc-24baaeff66a9::sentence-8",
              "documentId": "doc-24baaeff66a9",
              "text": "CDC said the decision comes after deliberating over data and new information, and because the passengers came from the epicenter of the outbreak in Wuhan. ",
              "start": 1175,
              "end": 1330,
              "direction": "PREVIOUS"
            }
          ],
          "context": "CDC said the decision comes after deliberating over data and new information, and because the passengers came from the epicenter of the outbreak in Wuhan. “If we take strong measures now, we may be able to blunt the impact of the virus on the United States,” said Nancy Messonnier, M.D., director of CDC’s National Center for Immunization and Respiratory Diseases."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
